-- build_almighty.luau - Studio EDIT mode, rerunnable:
--   python ~/.claude/skills/create-roblox-game/scripts/studio_mcp.py luau --file tools/studio/auras/build_almighty.luau
-- Builds ReplicatedStorage.Assets.Auras.TheAlmighty: Yhwach's (blood_war_king) hero aura, hand-authored with the
-- roblox-vfx skill's authoring route. Every texture and the cloak mesh are our own (tools/auras/almighty/make_tex.py,
-- make_cloak.py; ids in assets/auras/almighty/ids.json; glint/glow shared with ButterflyDance). Reads the cloak's
-- MeshPart from ServerStorage.AuraSources.TheAlmighty.Cloak (never delete); writes NOTHING but the template.
-- HeroAura.luau's template format: every CFrame in the hero ROOT's space at rest, R15, feet at y -3, faces -Z.
-- Yhwach: head centre y 1.59 (face at z -0.6), hair to ~0.9 behind his back, his own cape to ~1.5 behind his heels.
--
-- The look (Bleach TYBW, The Almighty, as it wraps him in the final arc): his shadow is a CLOAK of flat matte black
-- ink, studded with eyes that open, look about, blink and close (white, pale-blue rims, heavy black outline, small
-- irregular pupils). Nothing black glows; the eyes and the Quincy reishi are the only light. No flames.
--   CLOAK    a real mesh: a collar ring clasped at his throat, a mantle over his shoulders, deep leaning folds, a hem
--            torn into long points. Its cloth is black with liquid flow streaks, dim half-lidded eyes painted all
--            over it and a glossy dark-blue rim; bright animated eyes open on anchors ON its surface (densest on the
--            shoulders); ink strands hang and sway from the torn hem and drip into the pool
--   VEIL     a living ink mass over his upper head with nine eye spots opening on it (mouth and jaw stay clear)
--   CRAWL    ink running down the front of his body inside the cloak's opening, eyes opening in it
--   POOL     his shadow on the ground: a black splash pool (SurfaceGui) with eyes opening flat in it, looking up
--   CROWN    eyes manifesting in soft shadow round his head, on a slowly turning ring
--   REISHI   pale blue-white Quincy spirit motes rising; one cold blue-white light
-- Every particle faces the camera, so every eye looks at whoever is looking at him.

